possible. Present the garment fully spread out, carefully smoothed, neat, and visually flat, with the absolute minimum amount of visible wrinkling. Keep the fabric surface clean and smooth without making it look rigid, inflated, distorted, plastic, or artificially blurred. Preserve intentional structural design features such as pleats, gathers, quilting, ruching, and other deliberately constructed details, but eliminate all incidental wrinkles and unwanted folds.\n\nReplace the background with pure white (#FFFFFF). Use professional e-commerce product photography lighting with soft, even, neutral studio illumination. Add only a very subtle and realistic contact shadow directly beneath the garment to maintain natural depth. The lighting must not alter the garment’s original colors or conceal its texture and details.\n\nKeep the product centered with balanced, consistent margins around it. Produce a clean, high-resolution, commercially polished image with accurate colors, realistic fabric texture, sharp design details, clean edges, and premium e-commerce product photography quality.\n\nStrictly preserve the original product. Only change its presentation style. Do not redesign, recolor, reshape, beautify, replace, invent, or alter any product detail."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 101, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"widget": {"name": "resolution"}, "name": "COMBO", "links": [223], "label": "COMBO", "type": "COMBO"}], "size": [286.3079528808594, 106], "pos": [1182.20849609375, 347.8050537109375], "widgets_values": ["2k", "fixed", ""], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 141, "type": "PrimitiveNode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Run widget replace on values": false}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "slot_index": 0, "links": [1